[? if pres_2025_incumbent: The field is split between incumbent President
Trzaskowski, Nawrocki, Mentzen, Braun, Hołownia, two Left candidates and media
outsiders. Five years of vetoes, signed bills, PiS fracture and PiS
counter-mobilisation are now part of the incumbent's record.?]
[? if not pres_2025_incumbent: The field is split between [+
pres_2025_ko_candidate +], Nawrocki, Mentzen, Braun, Hołownia, two Left
candidates and media outsiders.?] The first answer decides whether the Left is
discussing government access, redistribution or another candidate's scandal.

