= June 2025 — Continuity is also a choice

The presidential result has not removed the cabinet's existing Sejm majority.
Without a resignation, coalition rupture or hostile-election shock, an extra
Article 160 vote would be political theatre rather than a constitutional
requirement. The cabinet continues under the confidence it already holds.

- @post_presidential_continuity_return: Continue without a confidence vote

